# Two-sided validation of Vcrit, reincorporated_pre_cap, reincorporated, metallicity and
# metals_reincorporated: deltaT (halo_age 0, effective_steps 1) chosen by exact emulation of G:50-52
# so that reincorporated is one double ulp below EjectedMass 0.6f (the cap does not bind),
# MetalsEjectedMass 0.075f (EjectedMass / 8) makes the metallicity exactly 1/8, and the CGM metals
# hold -0.075f: the ejected gas, the ejected metals (fused, G:61) and the CGM metals (X:80) all end
# at a tiny exact residual, which each neighbour of each local changes.
# Reachability: constructed routine-domain probe (a negative CGM metal reservoir and an exact
# equality built for two-sided validation).
# R4's flags: CGMrecipeOn 1 (par/R4.par:54); ReionizationOn 1, BaryonFrac 0.17,
# ReIncorporationFactor 0.19 and Reionization_z0/zr 8/7 as R3 (R4.par:51, :39, :72, :85-86).
format sage26-oracle-fixture 1
routine reincorporate_gas

f64 params.ReIncorporationFactor 0x3fc851eb851eb852  # 0.19
i32 params.CGMrecipeOn 1

f64 call.Age_galaxy_snap 0x3ee619fce1b18bb1  # 1.0538823565114449e-05  (Age[galaxies[p].SnapNum])
f64 call.halo_age 0x0000000000000000  # 0.0  (Age[halo_snapnum])
i32 call.effective_steps 1
i32 galaxy[0].Type 0
i32 galaxy[0].Regime 0
f32 galaxy[0].Vvir 0x44160000  # 600
f32 galaxy[0].Rvir 0x3d4ccccd  # 0.0500000007
f32 galaxy[0].EjectedMass 0x3f19999a  # 0.600000024
f32 galaxy[0].MetalsEjectedMass 0x3d99999a  # 0.075000003
f32 galaxy[0].HotGas 0x40400000  # 3
f32 galaxy[0].MetalsHotGas 0x3cf5c28f  # 0.0299999993
f32 galaxy[0].CGMgas 0x40000000  # 2
f32 galaxy[0].MetalsCGMgas 0xbd99999a  # -0.075000003
